1
00:00:21,388 --> 00:00:23,990
Is it okay to be like this on a first date?

2
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,826
Feels like we did this before

3
00:00:45,178 --> 00:00:46,346
Can I tie you?

4
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:03,229
Can I tie you up today?

5
00:01:35,829 --> 00:01:36,996
Hold on.

6
00:02:00,787 --> 00:02:01,855
Who is it?

7
00:02:01,855 --> 00:02:02,789
I don't no.

8
00:02:56,109 --> 00:02:57,177
I'm gonna cum.

9
00:02:57,644 --> 00:02:58,811
Me too.

10
00:03:17,764 --> 00:03:19,866
Why aren't you sleeping?

11
00:03:21,534 --> 00:03:24,237
How did you know I wasn't?

12
00:03:25,104 --> 00:03:27,840
Whenever you have something to say

13
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:30,510
You stare at me like that

14
00:03:34,214 --> 00:03:35,848
What is it?

15
00:03:38,284 --> 00:03:40,853
What if we fight again?

16
00:03:41,654 --> 00:03:43,189
Hurt each other again

17
00:03:43,189 --> 00:03:45,058
And break up again?

18
00:03:45,058 --> 00:03:47,060
We probably will

19
00:03:48,928 --> 00:03:51,664
We'll fight about not hearing back

20
00:03:52,298 --> 00:03:55,468
Fight about not being expressive enough

21
00:03:56,869 --> 00:03:59,839
Fight about not seeing each other's effort

22
00:04:02,275 --> 00:04:04,110
But Jihoon

23
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,414
After we broke up

24
00:04:08,414 --> 00:04:11,084
There's something I realized over the past year

25
00:04:11,618 --> 00:04:13,152
What is it?

26
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:16,189
No matter how much we fight

27
00:04:16,556 --> 00:04:19,859
Not having you by my side is a hundred times harder

28
00:04:23,363 --> 00:04:25,498
Even if we fight

29
00:04:25,498 --> 00:04:27,934
Let's stay together anyway

30
00:04:28,201 --> 00:04:30,370
Yeah, let's do that

31
00:04:50,223 --> 00:04:52,191
You're up?

32
00:04:52,191 --> 00:04:53,926
Why didn't you wake me to clean together…

33
00:04:53,926 --> 00:04:56,129
It's fine, get some more sleep

34
00:05:02,402 --> 00:05:04,370
Can you check my phone?

35
00:05:06,806 --> 00:05:08,107
Who is it?

36
00:05:08,107 --> 00:05:10,276
Just spam…

37
00:05:11,377 --> 00:05:14,447
Hyung, you still haven't deleted the app?

38
00:05:14,814 --> 00:05:16,816
Ah… that one?

39
00:05:16,949 --> 00:05:18,151
Come to think of it

40
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:19,986
When we met last time too

41
00:05:19,986 --> 00:05:22,789
It looked like you were messaging someone on the app

42
00:05:22,789 --> 00:05:24,257
Me?

43
00:05:24,257 --> 00:05:25,124
Yeah

44
00:05:25,124 --> 00:05:27,160
When you went to shower

45
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:30,363
I saw you open the app

46
00:05:35,001 --> 00:05:37,437
Here, look as much as you want

47
00:05:37,570 --> 00:05:38,438
So?

48
00:05:38,438 --> 00:05:40,206
Do you feel better now?

49
00:05:40,206 --> 00:05:41,240
What…?

50
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,376
Why didn't you talk to anyone?

51
00:05:43,643 --> 00:05:44,977
I told you

52
00:05:44,977 --> 00:05:47,347
You were the only one I talked to on the app

53
00:05:47,347 --> 00:05:49,148
That was really true?

54
00:05:49,148 --> 00:05:50,083
What..?

55
00:05:50,083 --> 00:05:52,552
Were you not believing me?

56
00:05:52,552 --> 00:05:54,687
That's more disappointing..

57
00:05:54,687 --> 00:05:56,923
No, it's just…

58
00:05:58,257 --> 00:06:00,259
I don't know

59
00:06:01,461 --> 00:06:04,097
Maybe I was looking for traces of you on the app

60
00:06:06,165 --> 00:06:09,202
But now that I've really found you…

61
00:06:10,770 --> 00:06:12,872
I don't need this anymore

62
00:06:14,674 --> 00:06:16,008
Want to delete the app together?

63
00:06:16,008 --> 00:06:19,812
[Remove Jack'd?
Delete app]

64
00:06:19,812 --> 00:06:22,081
[Delete Jack'd?
Delete]

65
00:06:32,458 --> 00:06:35,128
But why don't you wear the perfume I gave you?

66
00:06:35,395 --> 00:06:36,129
Yesterday

67
00:06:36,129 --> 00:06:37,296
And the day before that

68
00:06:38,831 --> 00:06:42,034
I just wanted to go back to the way it was

69
00:06:42,668 --> 00:06:43,302
Why?

70
00:06:43,302 --> 00:06:44,704
Without the perfume

71
00:06:44,704 --> 00:06:46,773
Do I not look sexy?

72
00:06:47,039 --> 00:06:48,608
No

73
00:06:48,608 --> 00:06:49,809
You know what?

74
00:06:49,809 --> 00:06:51,477
Even when you don't wear perfume

75
00:06:51,477 --> 00:06:53,846
That scent is already on you

76
00:06:55,214 --> 00:06:57,150
Same as you

77
00:06:57,150 --> 00:06:59,452
What's on me

78
00:07:02,755 --> 00:07:03,756
Why…?

79
00:07:03,756 --> 00:07:05,992
Is there something on my face?

80
00:07:06,692 --> 00:07:07,660
That's it

81
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:09,429
Come here

82
00:07:09,962 --> 00:07:12,331
Wait, right here?

83
00:07:12,331 --> 00:07:15,535
Wait wait wait wait

84
00:07:18,905 --> 00:07:20,473
Hyung, you know what?

85
00:07:20,473 --> 00:07:23,342
We actually fought the day we filmed that video too

86
00:07:23,342 --> 00:07:24,777
Was it?

87
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:27,413
You looked pretty happy though

88
00:07:27,413 --> 00:07:30,149
It was because of you not me

89
00:07:30,149 --> 00:07:32,718
You were tired and wanted to leave

90
00:07:32,718 --> 00:07:34,687
You got annoyed and that's why we fought

91
00:07:34,687 --> 00:07:36,823
Oh right, I remember

92
00:07:36,823 --> 00:07:38,724
What was I even upset about?

93
00:07:38,724 --> 00:07:39,725
I don't know…

94
00:07:39,725 --> 00:07:43,329
After that I couldn't even suggest going to exhibitions

95
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:46,399
So that's why

96
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:49,101
you seemed down at the last exhibition

97
00:07:52,071 --> 00:07:54,974
Hyung, so where are we going today?

98
00:07:54,974 --> 00:07:57,410
Today… I'm not sure

99
00:07:57,410 --> 00:07:59,946
I was thinking about a café in Namyangju

100
00:08:00,413 --> 00:08:02,448
Or should we go somewhere with a Namsan view?

101
00:08:02,448 --> 00:08:03,616
Namsan?

102
00:08:03,616 --> 00:08:05,618
Won't it be cold in this weather?

103
00:08:05,618 --> 00:08:07,487
We can just watch while drinking coffee

104
00:08:07,487 --> 00:08:09,589
Then should we go to Namsan?

105
00:08:09,589 --> 00:08:11,591
Let's go

106
00:08:13,893 --> 00:08:15,061
What are you filming?

107
00:08:15,061 --> 00:08:16,629
It's been a while

108
00:08:16,629 --> 00:08:18,197
It looks good though

109
00:08:18,197 --> 00:08:19,398
Only you look good

110
00:08:19,398 --> 00:08:21,100
No, we both look good

111
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,201
What should we have for dinner?

112
00:08:22,201 --> 00:08:23,736
Dinner?

113
00:08:23,736 --> 00:08:25,571
Should we do steak for once?

114
00:08:25,571 --> 00:08:28,441
Then is Mr Dojin paying?

115
00:08:28,441 --> 00:08:29,375
Me?

116
00:08:29,375 --> 00:08:30,343
Yeah

117
00:08:30,343 --> 00:08:33,312
The top usually pays

118
00:08:33,312 --> 00:08:34,847
Unless you want to switch

119
00:08:34,847 --> 00:08:36,482
Then I'll top today

120
00:08:36,482 --> 00:08:38,684
Sorry, I'll pay

121
00:08:38,684 --> 00:08:40,253
No, my bad, I'll get it

122
00:08:40,253 --> 00:08:41,420
Maybe we shouldn't have come

123
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:43,356
I can barely see anything

124
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,157
What are you talking about

125
00:08:45,157 --> 00:08:47,159
That's Namsan right there

126
00:08:47,827 --> 00:08:50,897
It's barely visible though

127
00:08:50,897 --> 00:08:53,232
It's just the fog

128
00:08:58,838 --> 00:09:00,239
Then let's go see Namsan up close

129
00:09:07,179 --> 00:09:08,347
This is actually really nice

130
00:09:08,347 --> 00:09:09,682
Right?

131
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:30,000
"The Long Relationship"
